        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>@[{!Var_OppMemberUserId}], @[{!Sov_OpportunityTeamMember.CreatedById}] has added you as a Team Member to this Opportunity. If you would like to receive opportunity updates within your Chatter digest, please follow this opportunity record.</text>
